      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just frustration though. it feels deeper than that. if you look at the math of my last decade, the trajectory is a straight line down. every project, every relationship, every attempt to fix things just accelerates the decline. it feels like a mathematical certainty at this point. why fight a trend that's already been calculated? it feels like trying to stop the heat death of the universe. it's just... inevitable.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
